const e={readingNotes:[{title:{zh:"风险是对组合的贡献",en:"Risk concerns contribution to a portfolio"},body:{zh:"论文从组合选择出发理解个股风险，而非仅用个股自身波动。一个证券如何与持有组合共同变化，决定它对组合风险的贡献。因此，高个股波动与高市场贝塔不是同一概念，经验检验必须对应理论中真正使用的风险定义。",en:"Risk is an asset's contribution to portfolio dispersion, not merely its standalone volatility. Comovement with the held portfolio matters. High individual volatility and high market beta are different concepts, and tests must match the theoretical risk definition."},reference:{url:"https://people.hec.edu/rosu/wp-content/uploads/sites/43/2023/09/Fama-MacBeth-Risk-return-and-equilibrium-Empirical-tests-1973.pdf",label:{zh:"1973年期刊版 · pp. 607–609",en:"1973 journal article · pp. 607–609"}}},{title:{zh:"把多个定价命题分别检验",en:"Test distinct pricing restrictions separately"},body:{zh:"作者区分风险收益关系的线性、非贝塔风险是否另有补偿，以及平均风险补偿是否为正等命题。某个截距限制失败，不必等于所有组合理论都失败。分开这些命题，有助于避免把一个统计结果解释成对整个模型体系的总判决。",en:"The paper separates linearity, compensation for non-beta risk and a positive average risk premium. Rejection of one intercept restriction need not reject every portfolio implication. Distinct hypotheses prevent a single statistic becoming a verdict on an entire framework."},reference:{url:"https://people.hec.edu/rosu/wp-content/uploads/sites/43/2023/09/Fama-MacBeth-Risk-return-and-equilibrium-Empirical-tests-1973.pdf",label:{zh:"1973年期刊版 · p. 613",en:"1973 journal article · p. 613"}}},{title:{zh:"贝塔是估计量，不是已知常数",en:"Beta is estimated rather than known"},body:{zh:"理论关系使用真实风险暴露，但研究只能从历史收益估计贝塔，因此解释变量本身带有误差。增加观测或形成组合可以帮助处理部分噪声，却不意味着问题自动消失。市场指数也只是代理，不是理论市场组合的完美直接观测。",en:"Theory uses true exposure, but empirical beta is estimated from historical returns. The regressor therefore contains error. More observations or portfolios can address some noise without eliminating the problem; the observed index is also only a market proxy."},reference:{url:"https://people.hec.edu/rosu/wp-content/uploads/sites/43/2023/09/Fama-MacBeth-Risk-return-and-equilibrium-Empirical-tests-1973.pdf",label:{zh:"1973年期刊版 · p. 614",en:"1973 journal article · p. 614"}}},{title:{zh:"排序期与重新估计期分开",en:"Separate sorting from re-estimation"},body:{zh:"按估计贝塔排序会把正向误差集中到高组、负向误差集中到低组。作者用一个时期形成组合，再用后续资料重新估计风险，减少这种选择造成的回归现象。若用同一窗口同时排序和验证，就改变了这项设计的含义。",en:"Sorting estimated betas groups positive errors at the top and negative errors at the bottom. The paper forms portfolios in one period and re-estimates risk using later data to mitigate that selection. Reusing one window for both changes the design."},reference:{url:"https://people.hec.edu/rosu/wp-content/uploads/sites/43/2023/09/Fama-MacBeth-Risk-return-and-equilibrium-Empirical-tests-1973.pdf",label:{zh:"1973年期刊版 · p. 615",en:"1973 journal article · p. 615"}}},{title:{zh:"每个月得到一次横截面比较",en:"Each month supplies a cross-sectional comparison"},body:{zh:"研究逐月将组合收益与事前估计的风险变量联系，得到一系列月度回归系数，再将这些系数用于检验。它不是把所有公司月份简单堆叠成一次回归。横截面的风险差异与时间上的系数变化，在这种方法中承担不同角色。",en:"Monthly portfolio returns are related to previously estimated risk variables, yielding a time series of coefficients for testing. This is not a single regression pooling all firm-months. Cross-sectional risk differences and coefficient variation over time play different roles."},reference:{url:"https://people.hec.edu/rosu/wp-content/uploads/sites/43/2023/09/Fama-MacBeth-Risk-return-and-equilibrium-Empirical-tests-1973.pdf",label:{zh:"1973年期刊版 · p. 616 · equation (10)",en:"1973 journal article · p. 616 · equation (10)"}}},{title:{zh:"历史样本和数据处理属于检验合同",en:"Sample and return conventions belong to the test"},body:{zh:"原研究使用历史NYSE普通股月度收益，包含分红与资本变动调整，并采用特定市场代理。换成另一市场、价格收益或不同组合权重，就是新的经验设计。保留方法名称并不能保证新结果与原文检验的对象完全相同。",en:"The study uses historical NYSE monthly common-stock returns with dividends and capital adjustments, plus a particular market proxy. Another market, price-only returns or different weights define a new empirical design even if the method keeps the same name."},reference:{url:"https://people.hec.edu/rosu/wp-content/uploads/sites/43/2023/09/Fama-MacBeth-Risk-return-and-equilibrium-Empirical-tests-1973.pdf",label:{zh:"1973年期刊版 · pp. 614–616",en:"1973 journal article · pp. 614–616"}}}],readerLimits:{zh:"两步回归不能自动消除测量误差或证明市场有效。本文的历史NYSE样本、市场代理和模型假设，共同限定了检验对象。",en:"Two-pass regressions do not automatically eliminate measurement error or establish efficiency. The historical NYSE sample, market proxy and model assumptions jointly define the test."}};export{e as default};
